Change(genesis='66602cd0dec37d58d03eec9518ca805a7ac38ea912d2b0c366a0b67b4b9f50b6', deps=('9adaa235580e908cd3d49494ee2c9835dcc09a30b294262e81bd39bdaba9606d',), event=Revised(decision='localnode', at=datetime(2026, 11, 1, 10, 58, 21, 939773), actor='assistant', title="The box's own node reads, and writes only as the operator, signed by the root key", body="The gate answers the box's own tailnet node as Local, which reads and never writes. A request from that node that names the root key and an actor some login writes as is admitted as the operator: the door proves it as it proves a device's request (window, nonce, a signature by a key the history trusts for that actor), every write is recorded under the root key, and the line's stamp names the operator's seat. The operator's tap on a card that sends mail is refused by the card's kind.", rationale='2026-11-01: the owner asked why live features waited on them to test, and approved operator asks and taps from the CLI for every act except sending mail (#294). A process holding the root key could already sign any chain object as any trusted actor, so the operator path adds no power; it records it.', supersedes=()))